@baseUrl = https://localhost:7272
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@imageId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@version = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@slug = example-product

### Public listing (published only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/commissions?offset=0&limit=20

### Public detail and image (administrator cookie permits draft preview)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/commissions/{{slug}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/commissions/{{id}}/images/{{imageId}}

### The remaining requests require an authenticated administrator cookie.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions?offset=0&limit=20

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions/{{id}}

### Create a draft; use returned id and version for subsequent requests.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Example","slug":"example-product","description":"Example description","basePrice":100.00,"options":[{"name":"Custom finish","price":20.00},{"name":"Color choice","price":null}]}

### Every mutation requires the latest returned version.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions/{{id}}?expectedVersion={{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Revised example","slug":"example-product","description":"Revised description","basePrice":120.00,"options":[]}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions/{{id}}/publication?expectedVersion={{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

true

### Replace the placeholder with a valid PNG, JPEG, GIF, or WEBP encoded as base64 (maximum decoded size 5 MiB).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions/{{id}}/images?expectedVersion={{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"filename":"example.png","contentType":"image/png","data":"<base64-image>","altText":"Example product"}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions/{{id}}/images/{{imageId}}?expectedVersion={{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

"Updated image description"

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions/{{id}}/images/order?expectedVersion={{version}}
Content-Type: application/json

["{{imageId}}"]

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions/{{id}}/images/{{imageId}}?expectedVersion={{version}}

###
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/commissions/{{id}}?expectedVersion={{version}}
